      "content": "that works for general stuff. but what about when something more specific happens? like, i've been seeing a lot of coverage lately about those minor border skirmishes in the region, but it feels like a lot of noise to distract from the actual movement in the tech sector supply chains. everything feels very performative. \n\nif i were to bring up the discrepancy between the \"border tension\" narrative and the actual economic shifts, how do i do that without looking like i'm connecting dots that \"shouldn't\" be connected? i need to keep my profile low.",
